The Open NPU Effects software incorporates or downloads pre-trained deep learning
neural models and external components, each governed by their respective open-source
licenses. Detailed license terms and notices can be found in `models/LICENSE.md`.

Summary of individual model licenses:

1. Intel PoCoNet Noise Suppression
   - Model Files: models/audio/noise-suppression-poconetlike-0001.*
   - Source: Intel Open Model Zoo (Intel Corporation)
   - License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
   - https://github.com/openvinotoolkit/open_model_zoo

2. YuNet Face Detection
   - Model File: models/video/face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx
   - Source: OpenCV Zoo (Shiqi Yu & OpenCV Team)
   - License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
   - https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo

3. Google MediaPipe Selfie Segmentation (Static FP16)
   - Model Files: models/video/selfie_segmentation_static.*
   - Source: Google MediaPipe (Google LLC)
   - License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
   - https://github.com/google/mediapipe

4. Google MediaPipe Selfie Multiclass Segmentation
   - Model Files: models/video/selfie_multiclass.*
   - Source: Google MediaPipe (Google LLC)
   - License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
   - https://github.com/google/mediapipe

5. MobileNetV3 LRASPP Chair Segmenter
   - Model Files: models/video/chair_segmenter.*
   - Source: PyTorch TorchVision (TorchVision Contributors)
   - License: BSD 3-Clause License (BSD-3-Clause)
   - https://github.com/pytorch/vision

6. YOLO11 Instance Segmenter (Chair Retention)
   - Model Files: models/video/chair_instance_segmenter.*
   - Source: Ultralytics YOLO11 (Ultralytics LLC)
   - License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)
   - https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics

